  <h1 style="color:#0d47a1; font-size:32px; font-weight:700;">Refund & Cancellation Policy</h1>
  <p style="color:#555; font-size:16px;"><strong>Effective Date:</strong> 20 May 2024</p>

  <p style="color:#000; font-size:16px;">
    At <strong>Clear All Exams</strong> (www.clearallexams.in) (formerly known as NISMExams.in), we provide high-quality digital learning resources to help students prepare effectively for NISM Certification Exams. Since our products are delivered instantly upon purchase, the following terms apply to refunds and cancellations.
  </p>

  <h2 style="color:#0d47a1; margin-top:25px;">1. Digital Products - No Cancellation After Purchase</h2>
  <p style="color:#000; font-size:16px;">
    Once access to any purchased digital product is provided, the service is considered delivered. Therefore:
    <br>(a) Orders cannot be cancelled after payment.
    <br>(b) Purchases cannot be transferred to another user or account.
  </p>

  <h2 style="color:#0d47a1; margin-top:25px;">2. Refunds for Duplicate or Failed Payments</h2>
  <p style="color:#000; font-size:16px;">
    Refunds are only applicable in the following cases:
  </p>
  <ul style="color:#000; font-size:16px; margin-left:20px;">
    <li>Duplicate payment - <strong>Full refund after verification</strong></li>
    <li>Payment deducted but access not activated - <strong>Full refund or access restored</strong></li>
    <li>Failed transaction but amount deducted - <strong>Refund as per gateway timelines</strong></li>
  </ul>

  <h2 style="color:#0d47a1; margin-top:25px;">3. Wrong Product Purchased (Replacement Policy)</h2>
  <p style="color:#000; font-size:16px;">
    If a wrong module is purchased:
    <br>(a) Access will be shifted to the correct course of equal value.
    <br>(b)If the correct course has a higher price, the difference must be paid.
    <br>(c) Refunds are not provided in this case.
  </p>

  <h2 style="color:#0d47a1; margin-top:25px;">4. No Refunds for Accessed or Used Products</h2>
  <p style="color:#000; font-size:16px;">
    A refund is not possible if:
  </p>
  <ul style="color:#000; font-size:16px; margin-left:20px;">
    <li>Mock tests have been attempted</li>
    <li>Study material / PDFs have been downloaded</li>
    <li>Video lectures have been viewed</li>
    <li>Login shows multi-device misuse</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 style="color:#0d47a1; margin-top:25px;">5. Case-by-Case Review (Discretionary)</h2>
  <p style="color:#000; font-size:16px;">
    Exceptional cases may be reviewed individually. This is not a guaranteed approval and remains at the sole discretion of Clear All Exams.
  </p>

  <h2 style="color:#0d47a1; margin-top:25px;">6. Refund Request Timeline</h2>
  <p style="color:#000; font-size:16px;">
    Eligible refund requests must be submitted within <strong>48 hours</strong> of the transaction.
  </p>

  <h2 style="color:#0d47a1; margin-top:25px;">7. How to Request a Refund</h2>
  <p style="color:#000; font-size:16px;">
    Email: <a href="mailto:info@clearallexams.in" style="color:#1565c0;">info@clearallexams.in</a>
    <br>Phone: +91-7518147771
    <br><br>Please include:
  </p>
  <ul style="color:#000; font-size:16px; margin-left:20px;">
    <li>Registered Name</li>
    <li>Registered Email / Mobile Number</li>
    <li>Payment Screenshot / Transaction ID</li>
    <li>Reason for Request</li>
  </ul>
  <p style="color:#000; font-size:16px;">
    Refunds are processed within <strong>5-7 working days</strong> after verification.
  </p>

  <h2 style="color:#0d47a1; margin-top:25px;">8. Legal Compliance</h2>
  <p style="color:#000; font-size:16px;">
    This policy complies with:
    <br>(a) Consumer Protection Act, 2019
    <br>(b) Information Technology Act, 2000
    <br>(c) E-Commerce Rules, 2020
    <br><br>Jurisdiction: Gautam Buddha Nagar, Uttar Pradesh, India.
  </p>

